    <!--
      Only the handful of tokens the PLATFORM needs before Compose starts
      (window background, status bar). The full 22-token palette is Kotlin, in
      ui/theme/Color.kt, which is the single source of truth.

      iOS keeps its palette in the asset catalog because launch screens can only
      reference catalog colors. Android has no such constraint (PARITY.md §13),
      so these two must stay in sync by hand — keep this list minimal.
    -->
